              <span class="relative inline-flex h-4 w-4 rounded-full bg-red-600 shadow-[0_0_0_6px_rgba(220,38,38,0.2)]"></span>
            </span>
            <div>
              <h2 class="text-[16px] font-black leading-tight text-slate-950">Reaksi Cepat, Alami &amp; Aman di Jantung!</h2>
